Reproducible-builds reconnaissance scripts (scratch; not part of the build).
No compiler source was modified.

t_path.sh      - vary build directory path, hold source identical
t_name.sh      - vary source filename; absolute vs relative source path
t_env.sh       - vary time-of-day and TZ/LC_ALL/LANG/HOSTNAME/USER/TMPDIR/
                 SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH/PWD
t_datemacro.sh - __DATE__/__TIME__/__TIMESTAMP__ behaviour
t_flags.sh     - acceptance of common reproducible-build flags
t_misc.sh      - ASLR (setarch -R), umask, link input order, batch vs
                 individual -c, `tcc -ar` archive determinism
src.c b.c c.c  - fixtures
